  {
   "id": "mio-memories-in-orbit-306141@1.2",
   "gameId": "mio-memories-in-orbit-306141",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.2",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-02-06T10:12:39.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "This is our very first update since launch, and we want to start by saying a huge thank you for all the love, feedback, and support you’ve shown MIO: Memories in Orbit so far, it truly means the world to us. 🫶​",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Patch 1.2 focuses on quality-of-life improvements, gameplay and balance tweaks, and a wide range of bug fixes aimed at making your journey through the station smoother, clearer, and more enjoyable overall. [img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45065449/3a2d6477b3aad6d9cd671c84e88380f00bece9e2.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45065449/046bb7dbc4f7cce9d1230592a8e84cf578791c4e.jpg\"]🐛 Bug Fixes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Fix a bug where the fourth tremor would trigger too early (sorry)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix a bug where the boss assist (\"Eroded Bosses\") would not work on some combination of boss fight and respawn checkpoint",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix HUD logic for the \"Hand's greed\" modifier feedback",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix the invisible trapdoor after the Dr Halyn fight",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix invisible ceiling in",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix lootable nacre through ceiling in Foundations",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix missing corpse for Calderon after the fight",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix collider/visual mismatch in the shuttle shafts (esp ice section)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix Capucine's statue dialogs",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Small typo fixes in game texts",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "⚔️ Gameplay & Combat Tweaks",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Tweak attack direction selection logic for d-pad & keyboard to help with pogo misses",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "balance",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Change the \"Hand's greed\" modifier to also use decayed health (tremor) as an additional damage boost source",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Tweak hitbox behavior for the FRIENDS fight",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Tune Shii armor during certain animations",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Apply damage upgrades to scrap pile attacks",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45065449/d3e37f7aa9ab79092fec5d936c4248a46c21b4e9.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🎮 Balance & Difficulty",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Tune the ending section of Sawlong to make it slightly less punishing",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Remove low health feedback during the Khlia sequence",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Remove some health bars in the Pit",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🗺️ Level Design & Progression",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Remove the alternate path in the striders tutorial section",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Change the entrance shortcut of the Chapel to avoid misleading people into not doing the level",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Change metropolis entrance to allow escaping even after sequence break",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Tweak some respawn zone in Metropolis platforming gauntlets",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45065449/91b2a2681a498e26f59d7a37f7867562e62e4a88.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🎥 Camera & Presentation",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Improve camera handling during the Vlad fight",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "⏱️ Quality of Life",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Speed up the Sol&Vin elevator after the first fight attempt",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Speed up the Shuttles once Dr Halyn has been encountered the first time",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Shorten input lock on checkpoint after death",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45065449/3491e2e5609738a4abf0e3199ff860e34c4ac9d7.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🎨 Visual Clarity & Environment",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Tweak a couple background elements that could be confused with walkable platforms in the Haven",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Tweak the visuals for the drawer secret passageway in the Vaults",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🧾 Credits & Meta",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "in the credits ❤️",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Credits update (font list, production babies)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45065449/3a2d6477b3aad6d9cd671c84e88380f00bece9e2.png\"]We can’t wait to hear what you think! Thank you for being part of the MIO journey. 🚀",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45065449/26a59acd625e23422a6881f0939f62a0822333a9.gif\"]Now, let's play!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
