  {
   "id": "mio-memories-in-orbit-306141@major-2025-12-04",
   "gameId": "mio-memories-in-orbit-306141",
   "displayName": "MIO: Memories in Orbit’s Demo: Major Update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-12-04T20:17:02.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "MIO: Memories in Orbit’s free demo just received a major update! Here’s everything you need to know.💫​",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"justify\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"justify\"]Exciting news! We’ve just released a major update for the MIO demo bringing smoother performance, better accessibility, improved visuals, and greater stability across the board.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"justify\"]Whether you’re returning for another run or jumping in for the first time, there’s no better moment to experience the demo at its best! 🫶",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"justify\"]Play it now!​",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45065449/3a2d6477b3aad6d9cd671c84e88380f00bece9e2.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45065449/d2c6ad0e4a714e3e7b9102bfa01d2e751fb03922.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "✨ Major improvements",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Better compatibility: the demo should now run on many more configurations, including older PCs",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Big optimization pass: improved performance on both CPU & GPU",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added 2K / 4K support: enjoy higher-resolution visuals on supported displays",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"justify\"]🧩 Accessibility additions",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Option to disable the low-HP vignette: reduce screen effects when your health is low",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Option to increase text size: makes menus and dialogue easier to read",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Full controller remapping",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"justify\"]🗺️ Visual improvements",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Map visual rework: clearer design for better readability and navigation",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"justify\"]🔧 General tweaks",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Various bug fixes & improvements",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Small economy and balance adjustments",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45065449/75942514bf6b9a378d82b5b3c253f40d6059d678.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "⚠️ A few notes before you jump in",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Please note that old demo saves are not compatible with this new version.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The demo will remain available until December 19, ahead of the full game’s release one month later, and save files from the demo will not carry over to the final game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45065449/3a2d6477b3aad6d9cd671c84e88380f00bece9e2.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45065449/2f2815b6504fa03ec5134ec0f91a2a2387bd68e2.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Play the demo now if you haven’t already!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
